You recently used an online document translation service for an important business document. The translation was completed before the deadline, but there were several errors that caused confusion with your business partners. Write an email to the translation service manager in about 150-200 words. Your email should do the following things: 
- Provide details about your original document and when you submitted it 
- Explain the specific translation errors and how they affected your business communication 
- Request appropriate compensation and suggest how they can improve their service quality
